{"title":"Plaster","sourceTitle":"Plaster/pt-br","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages noprint navigation-not-searchable\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages-label\">Other languages:</div><ul class=\"mw-pt-languages-list\"><li><a href=\"/Plaster\" class=\"mw-pt-languages-ui mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Plaster (100% translated)\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">English</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Plaster/es\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--high\" title=\"Yeso (77% translated)\" lang=\"es\" dir=\"ltr\">español</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-pt-languages-selected mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\">português do Brasil</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Plaster/ru\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--high\" title=\"Гипс (85% translated)\" lang=\"ru\" dir=\"ltr\">русский</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Plaster/zh\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--med\" title=\"石膏块 (15% translated)\" lang=\"zh\" dir=\"ltr\">中文</a></li></ul></div><div style=\"float:right;\">\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"position:relative; border-radius:7px; font-size:90%; width:200px; float:right; margin-left:5px; margin-bottom: 5px;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"border-top-right-radius:7px; border-top-left-radius:7px; text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Plaster</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#d3ab92\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Plaster-plain.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/5/58/Plaster-plain.png/100px-Plaster-plain.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/5/58/Plaster-plain.png/150px-Plaster-plain.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/5/58/Plaster-plain.png/200px-Plaster-plain.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Material</b>\n</td>\n<td>Stone\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Empilhável</b>\n</td>\n<td>64\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Gotas</b>\n</td>\n<td>Itself\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" class=\"Bloba\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px; border-bottom-right-radius:7px; border-bottom-left-radius:7px;\"><a href=\"/Blocks\" title=\"Blocks\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Blocos</b></font></a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table><br style=\"clear:both\" />\n</div>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Criação\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Criação</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Fazendo_limão\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Fazendo limão</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Elaboração_de_cal_viva\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Elaboração de cal viva</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Elaboração_de_gesso_simples\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Elaboração de gesso simples</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Criação_de_variantes_de_gesso\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Criação de variantes de gesso</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Uso\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Uso</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Componente_Construção\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Componente Construção</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Tipos_de_bloco\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Tipos de bloco</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<p>Os jogadores podem criar quatro versões de blocos de gesso. Todos os blocos de gesso começam com a confecção de blocos de gesso simples. Os blocos simples são modificados adicionando <a href=\"/Boards\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Boards\">tábuas</a> para criar os outros três tipos. \n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Cria.C3.A7.C3.A3o\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Criação\">Criação</span></h2>\n<p>Os blocos de gesso requerem <a href=\"/Sand\" title=\"Sand\">areia</a>, <a href=\"/Firepit\" title=\"Firepit\">fogueira</a>, <a href=\"/Quern\" title=\"Quern\">moinho manual</a> e giz ou calcário <a href=\"/Rock\" title=\"Rock\">pedras pequenas</a> para serem criados. <a href=\"/Boards\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Boards\">Tábuas</a> são um componente opcional. \n</p>\n<ul><li>Formas de Bloco: Somente Blocos Completos podem ser criados. Não há Lajes de Gesso (meio bloco), nem Escadas.</li>\n<li>Variante de Material: Qualquer variante <a href=\"/Sand\" title=\"Sand\">areia</a> pode ser usada para criar esses blocos. As pedras pequenas devem ser de giz ou cal.</li>\n<li>Aparência: A colocação de <a href=\"/Boards\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Boards\">tábuas</a> no último estágio de fabricação afeta a aparência do bloco, mas qualquer tipo de tabuleiro pode ser usado para fabricar.</li></ul>\n<h3><span id=\"Fazendo_lim.C3.A3o\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Fazendo_limão\">Fazendo limão</span></h3>\n<p>Para obter <a href=\"/Lime\" title=\"Lime\">cal</a>, localize giz ou calcário <a href=\"/Rock#special_use_small_stones\" title=\"Rock\">pedras pequenas</a> e extraia a rocha ou colete pequenas pedras. \nEm seguida, triture as pedras em <a href=\"/Quern\" title=\"Quern\">moinho manual</a>.\n</p>\n<h3><span id=\"Elabora.C3.A7.C3.A3o_de_cal_viva\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Elaboração_de_cal_viva\">Elaboração de cal viva</span></h3>\n<p>Converta o <a href=\"/Lime\" title=\"Lime\">cal</a> em cal viva cozinhando o pó de cal usando um <a href=\"/Firepit\" title=\"Firepit\">fogueira</a>. Cada cal viva requer dois pó de cal.\n</p>\n<h3><span id=\"Elabora.C3.A7.C3.A3o_de_gesso_simples\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Elaboração_de_gesso_simples\">Elaboração de gesso simples</span></h3>\n<p>Para montar blocos de gesso, combine cal virgem e areia na grau de artesanato conforme mostrado abaixo.\n</p>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r429685\">.mw-parser-output .gridItem{width:50px;height:50px;position:absolute}.mw-parser-output .gridItemNumber{bottom:4px;right:4px;position:absolute;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-weight:bold;font-size:21px;line-height:17px;text-align:right;color:white}</style><div style=\"float:left;\">\n<div style=\"width:174px; height:248px; transform:translate(0,0); -webkit-text-stroke:0.13em black; paint-order:stroke fill;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"/images/d/d8/Crafting_GUI_wide_with_output.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"174\" height=\"248\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"174\" data-file-height=\"248\" /></span></span><div style=\"left:11px; top:13px; position:absolute;\"><div class=\"gridItem\" style=\"left:51px; top:51px;\">\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/Quicklime\" title=\"Quicklime\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/7/74/Quicklime.png/50px-Quicklime.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/7/74/Quicklime.png/75px-Quicklime.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/7/74/Quicklime.png/100px-Quicklime.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></div><div class=\"gridItem\" style=\"left:51px; top:102px;\">\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/Granite_sand\" title=\"Granite sand\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/c/c1/Grid_Granite_sand.png/50px-Grid_Granite_sand.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/c/c1/Grid_Granite_sand.png/75px-Grid_Granite_sand.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/c/c1/Grid_Granite_sand.png/100px-Grid_Granite_sand.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></div><div class=\"gridItem\" style=\"left:51px; top:173px;\">\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/Plain_plaster\" title=\"Plain plaster\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/5/58/Plaster-plain.png/50px-Plaster-plain.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/5/58/Plaster-plain.png/75px-Plaster-plain.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/5/58/Plaster-plain.png/100px-Plaster-plain.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></div></div></div></div><p><br style=\"clear:both\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h3><span id=\"Cria.C3.A7.C3.A3o_de_variantes_de_gesso\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Criação_de_variantes_de_gesso\">Criação de variantes de gesso</span></h3>\n<p>Organizar qualquer tipo de <a href=\"/Boards\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Boards\">tábuas</a> ao redor do bloco de gesso cria três versões alternativas de blocos com toras em padrões diferentes. Coloque tábuas e gesso simples na grau de artesanato conforme mostrado abaixo.\n</p>\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r429685\" /><div style=\"float:left;\">\n<div style=\"width:174px; height:248px; transform:translate(0,0); -webkit-text-stroke:0.13em black; paint-order:stroke fill;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"/images/d/d8/Crafting_GUI_wide_with_output.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"174\" height=\"248\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"174\" data-file-height=\"248\" /></span></span><div style=\"left:11px; top:13px; position:absolute;\"><div class=\"gridItem\" style=\"left:51px; top:0px;\">\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/Oak_Board\" title=\"Oak Board\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/5/53/Plank-oak.png/50px-Plank-oak.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/5/53/Plank-oak.png/75px-Plank-oak.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/5/53/Plank-oak.png/100px-Plank-oak.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></div><div class=\"gridItem\" style=\"left:51px; top:51px;\">\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/Plain_plaster\" title=\"Plain plaster\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/5/58/Plaster-plain.png/50px-Plaster-plain.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/5/58/Plaster-plain.png/75px-Plaster-plain.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/5/58/Plaster-plain.png/100px-Plaster-plain.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></div><div class=\"gridItem\" style=\"left:51px; top:102px;\">\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/Oak_Board\" title=\"Oak Board\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/5/53/Plank-oak.png/50px-Plank-oak.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/5/53/Plank-oak.png/75px-Plank-oak.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/5/53/Plank-oak.png/100px-Plank-oak.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></div><div class=\"gridItem\" style=\"left:51px; top:173px;\">\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/Straight_logs_plaster\" title=\"Straight logs plaster\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/c/cc/Grid_Straight_logs_plaster.png/50px-Grid_Straight_logs_plaster.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/c/cc/Grid_Straight_logs_plaster.png/75px-Grid_Straight_logs_plaster.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/c/cc/Grid_Straight_logs_plaster.png/100px-Grid_Straight_logs_plaster.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></div></div></div></div>\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r429685\" /><div style=\"float:left;\">\n<div style=\"width:174px; height:248px; transform:translate(0,0); -webkit-text-stroke:0.13em black; paint-order:stroke fill;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"/images/d/d8/Crafting_GUI_wide_with_output.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"174\" height=\"248\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"174\" data-file-height=\"248\" /></span></span><div style=\"left:11px; top:13px; position:absolute;\"><div class=\"gridItem\" style=\"left:0px; top:51px;\">\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/Oak_Board\" title=\"Oak Board\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/5/53/Plank-oak.png/50px-Plank-oak.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/5/53/Plank-oak.png/75px-Plank-oak.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/5/53/Plank-oak.png/100px-Plank-oak.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></div><div class=\"gridItem\" style=\"left:51px; top:0px;\">\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/Oak_Board\" title=\"Oak Board\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/5/53/Plank-oak.png/50px-Plank-oak.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/5/53/Plank-oak.png/75px-Plank-oak.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/5/53/Plank-oak.png/100px-Plank-oak.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></div><div class=\"gridItem\" style=\"left:51px; top:51px;\">\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/Plain_plaster\" title=\"Plain plaster\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/5/58/Plaster-plain.png/50px-Plaster-plain.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/5/58/Plaster-plain.png/75px-Plaster-plain.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/5/58/Plaster-plain.png/100px-Plaster-plain.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></div><div class=\"gridItem\" style=\"left:51px; top:102px;\">\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/Oak_Board\" title=\"Oak Board\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/5/53/Plank-oak.png/50px-Plank-oak.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/5/53/Plank-oak.png/75px-Plank-oak.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/5/53/Plank-oak.png/100px-Plank-oak.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></div><div class=\"gridItem\" style=\"left:102px; top:51px;\">\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/Oak_Board\" title=\"Oak Board\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/5/53/Plank-oak.png/50px-Plank-oak.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/5/53/Plank-oak.png/75px-Plank-oak.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/5/53/Plank-oak.png/100px-Plank-oak.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></div><div class=\"gridItem\" style=\"left:51px; top:173px;\">\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/Square_logs_plaster\" title=\"Square logs plaster\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/c/c0/Grid_Square_logs_plaster.png/50px-Grid_Square_logs_plaster.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/c/c0/Grid_Square_logs_plaster.png/75px-Grid_Square_logs_plaster.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/c/c0/Grid_Square_logs_plaster.png/100px-Grid_Square_logs_plaster.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></div></div></div></div>\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r429685\" /><div style=\"float:left;\">\n<div style=\"width:174px; height:248px; transform:translate(0,0); -webkit-text-stroke:0.13em black; paint-order:stroke fill;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"/images/d/d8/Crafting_GUI_wide_with_output.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"174\" height=\"248\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"174\" data-file-height=\"248\" /></span></span><div style=\"left:11px; top:13px; position:absolute;\"><div class=\"gridItem\" style=\"left:0px; top:0px;\">\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/Oak_Board\" title=\"Oak Board\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/5/53/Plank-oak.png/50px-Plank-oak.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/5/53/Plank-oak.png/75px-Plank-oak.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/5/53/Plank-oak.png/100px-Plank-oak.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></div><div class=\"gridItem\" style=\"left:51px; top:51px;\">\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/Plain_plaster\" title=\"Plain plaster\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/5/58/Plaster-plain.png/50px-Plaster-plain.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/5/58/Plaster-plain.png/75px-Plaster-plain.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/5/58/Plaster-plain.png/100px-Plaster-plain.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></div><div class=\"gridItem\" style=\"left:102px; top:102px;\">\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/Oak_Board\" title=\"Oak Board\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/5/53/Plank-oak.png/50px-Plank-oak.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/5/53/Plank-oak.png/75px-Plank-oak.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/5/53/Plank-oak.png/100px-Plank-oak.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></div><div class=\"gridItem\" style=\"left:51px; top:173px;\">\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/Diagonal_logs_plaster\" title=\"Diagonal logs plaster\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/9/9d/Grid_Diagonal_logs_plaster.png/50px-Grid_Diagonal_logs_plaster.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/9/9d/Grid_Diagonal_logs_plaster.png/75px-Grid_Diagonal_logs_plaster.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/9/9d/Grid_Diagonal_logs_plaster.png/100px-Grid_Diagonal_logs_plaster.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></div></div></div></div><p><br style=\"clear:both\" />\n</p><p><br />\n<span id=\"Usage\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Uso\">Uso</span></h2>\n<h3><span id=\"Componente_Constru.C3.A7.C3.A3o\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Componente_Construção\">Componente Construção</span></h3>\n<p>Os blocos de gesso são usados principalmente para criar estruturas de jogadores.\n</p>\n<ul><li>Especial: Quando colocados, os blocos de gesso diagonais e retos apresentam faces diferentes em direções diferentes. A orientação do bloco depende da direção que o jogador enfrenta ao colocar o bloco.</li></ul>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Tipos_de_bloco\">Tipos de bloco</span></h4>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Plain</th>\n<th>Straight Logs</th>\n<th>Square Logs</th>\n<th>Diagonal Logs\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Plaster-plain.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Incolor\"><img alt=\"Incolor\" src=\"/images/thumb/5/58/Plaster-plain.png/130px-Plaster-plain.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"130\" height=\"130\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/5/58/Plaster-plain.png/195px-Plaster-plain.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/5/58/Plaster-plain.png/260px-Plaster-plain.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Grid_Straight_logs_plaster.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Direto\"><img alt=\"Direto\" src=\"/images/thumb/c/cc/Grid_Straight_logs_plaster.png/130px-Grid_Straight_logs_plaster.png\" decoding=\"async\"